#  Pseudo-PFLOW .gitignore
# ----- Claude Code local settings -----
# ----- Compressed / archive files -----
# ----- Config test variants (local experiments) -----
# ----- Environment files -----
# ----- Generated docs -----
# ----- IDE / Editor -----
# ----- JARs (use Maven for dependencies) -----
# ----- Java build artifacts -----
# ----- Jupyter / Python -----
# ----- Large binary data files -----
# ----- Local compile scripts (contain hardcoded machine paths) -----
# ----- Local scratch scripts (leading underscore = local-only) -----
# ----- Log files -----
# ----- Maven wrapper (optional, regenerable) -----
# ----- OS files -----
# ----- Runtime working dirs (LOCAL-ONLY, regenerable) -----
# ----- Simulation output (large, regenerable) -----
# ----- Stray JARs at project root -----
# ----- Temp / backup files -----
# =============================================
# Build output directories
# Compressed files
# IntelliJ IDEA project files
# Intermediate or large data files (optional)
# Java build artifacts
# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
# Local archive (decommissioned artifacts kept for reference)
# Log files
# Machine-local config (never commit)
# Python cache (if scripts are used)
# Run scripts live in ../scripts/ and are tracked there
# Temporary files
# Tuning and staging output
# Visual Studio Code
# Windows system files
# macOS system files
